BT /F2 10.5 Tf 50.00 750.00 Td (Step 6: Honey Encryption & Decoy Honeypot) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.240 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 735.00 Td (Traditional authentication alerts attackers with 'Access Denied'. Under Honey Encryption, the payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 721.00 Td (card number is encoded with a Distribution-Transforming Encoder \(DTE\). Entering the correct PIN \(4829\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 707.00 Td (returns the real card \('4532-1234-5678-9012'\). Any incorrect guess \(e.g. 1234\) produces a plausible synthetic) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 693.00 Td (credit card number \('4916-XXXX-XXXX-2345'\). The intruder wastes effort attempting to exploit decoy credentials.) Tj ET
0.120 0.300 0.650 rg
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 50.00 669.00 Td (Step 7: Searchable Symmetric Encryption \(SSE\)) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.240 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 654.00 Td (Encrypted event logs are indexed using blinded cryptographic trapdoors: T_w = HMAC\(K_search, keyword\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 640.00 Td (Operators can search by vehicle camera ID or timestamp without decrypting the underlying database or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 626.00 Td (revealing what query term was requested.) Tj ET
0.120 0.300 0.650 rg
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 50.00 602.00 Td (Step 8: Paillier Homomorphic Encryption \(HE\)) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.240 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 587.00 Td (To calculate total municipal parking availability across independent edge boxes, each box encrypts its free) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 573.00 Td (spot count with the Paillier cryptosystem. A central server multiplies the ciphertexts: Enc\(m1\) * Enc\(m2\) =) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 559.00 Td (Enc\(m1 + m2\). The city decrypts only the final sum without learning individual lot numbers.) Tj ET
0.120 0.300 0.650 rg
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 50.00 535.00 Td (Step 9: Multi-Role JWT Token Architecture) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.240 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 520.00 Td (Issues cryptographically signed tokens: Operator JWT \(administrative session\), City Payment JWT) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 506.00 Td (\(automated wallet deduction\), and Ticket Handover JWT \(mobile app handover for contactless gate exit\).) Tj ET
0.120 0.300 0.650 rg
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 50.00 482.00 Td (Step 10: Driver Privacy-Preserving Safeguards) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.240 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 467.00 Td (Four layers of privacy: 1\) SHA-256 license plate hashing, 2\) Visual plate blurring \(DL03**9012\), 3\) Location) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 453.00 Td (precision reduction to 2 decimal places \(~1.1 km area\), and 4\) Ephemeral device UUID rotation every 10 frames.) Tj ET
0.120 0.300 0.650 rg
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 50.00 429.00 Td (Step 11: Token-Bucket Rate Limiter & Flood Defense) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.240 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 414.00 Td (Maintains a token bucket \(10 token burst capacity, 2 tokens/sec refill\). When an outdoor camera is hacked) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 400.00 Td (and floods 20 frames/sec, the edge box exhausts tokens and quarantines the device within 0.05 seconds.) Tj ET
